      "message": "good question. The noise source may include simple post-processing functions to improve the quality of its outputs. When a post-processing function is used, the noise source shall use only one of the approved post-processing functions: Von Neumann’s method, the linear filtering method, or the length-of-runs method. \nIf it\u0027s implementation is not any of mentioned - it\u0027s not considered approved. Check https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media//Publications/sp/800-90b/draft/documents/sp800-90b_second_draft.pdf Appendix E for details of methods and 3.2.2 for requirements.",
